WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.475
So what does the code build?

2
00:00:01.475 --> 00:00:05.488
It starts with one reader that every
chapter in this workbook shares.

3
00:00:05.488 --> 00:00:09.273
Its script blocks are the only
things that touch the network,

4
00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:12.075
a live one for real runs
and a fake one for labs.

5
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:14.292
And it enforces five simple rules:

6
00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:18.569
it makes only the calls the
configuration declares, it only reads,

7
00:00:18.569 --> 00:00:21.499
it sends the token only
to the cloud's own host,

8
00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:25.775
it checks it's signed in to the right
tenant, and it reads every page.

9
00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:30.620
The fake hands back tiny pages on purpose,
so paging gets tested everywhere.
